TEST FIXTURE ONLY - never a real credential. A self-signed EC P-256 pair for the in-process
fake SMTP relay (scripts/smtpFake.ts); trusted by the client only through smtp.trustCaForTest.
SAN DNS:localhost only (an IP address deliberately does not match). Made with:
  openssl req -x509 -newkey ec -pkeyopt ec_paramgen_curve:P-256 -nodes -days 36500 \
    -subj "/CN=localhost" -addext "subjectAltName=DNS:localhost" \
    -keyout test-only-localhost.key.pem -out test-only-localhost.cert.pem

